     1	# Movement brief — MOVEMENT-001 · "Unmeasured"
     2	
     3	- Book id: the-fractured-path / book-07-void-roads (Monroe Jackson 1.3 edition)
     4	- Series id: the-fractured-path
     5	- Author: Opus (Claude Opus 5.5) requested
