  1139	- **The lake house's Blade (flag):** unnamed, Iron Rank Five, fair, good-humoured; a lath in a canvas sleeve; commits in three beats (heel, hip, edge) and cannot take a commitment back; lays a line across a path. Exhibition on the Crown yard: three cards (the lake house's instructor, the Mire instructor, the Stone); 28 to 26.
