editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/STATE_LEDGER.md:231:- **Lira's Kindling: "a minute and a half", Copper Rank One.** **Flag** against Books 1–2 of the edition.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/STATE_LEDGER.md:246:- RANK vs STANDING (binding): rank, like tier, changes only by an advancement evaluation and is written on the registry certificate; a standing is this season's chalk (ladder position, seed, crown, squad). The ten-rank tier system is LOCKED — Fiske's Rank Eight is the limit of her certificate (two years unchanged), not of Copper.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/STATE_LEDGER.md:247:- Lira: ladder-book position the sixty-fifth and last line ("the foot", M2); SEEDED 22nd by Bracken's half-sheet (last season's 21 entrants first, then new names by formal rank; Cu 2 above the first-year Rank Ones). "The ladder book was not the bracket."
