    13	## Where we enter
    14	
    15	The academic year's last month [B5-reconciled 2026-10-05: season word struck; audit A1]. Two closing sittings at Ostrand. Brom's review on the year's last Fifth-day. The second Velmere envelope unopened. Three boxes roped.
    16	
    17	## What this movement is for
    18	
    19	Let the system finish its sentence entirely as procedure — nobody dishonest anywhere — and then price every stake in its owner's voice, so leaving is a decision and not a reaction. End with one honest fight the place is owed.
