    53	- **Seasons:** late summer into the back of autumn, with first snow on the 129th. The mail ferry runs monthly: inbound on about the 60th and the 91st; outbound on the 102nd; the last run on the 130th.
    54	- **Road times (prose, fixed):** Lowmarch ↔ Thornwater two days; Thornwater → the Fallow rise two days; Lowmarch → Oxhollow six days (north-west); Lowmarch → Millrace one day south on the Stair road; Millrace's fork → the Stair's line the same afternoon; the Stair → the Hall three days along the bearing; the Hall → the fork one day; the fork → the fourth site a day and a half; the fourth site → Lowmarch six days; the fourth site's gap → Thornwater four days.
