+### B3. The Gold read's air-or-body choice is absent from every B7 use
+
+- **B7 says:** `STATE_LEDGER.md:71` gives only range, mass/vector, and price; `BOOK_MAP.md:187` sends the read across the line, under his soles, and under water; M5 makes it run “under his soles the whole retreat” (`MOVEMENT-005.md:22`).
