3. Inventory bodies and every object: Hesk satchel and remaining leaves; three boxes and their contents; Seln's case; cart/horse or substitutes; purse; printed sheet; Ternhall straightedge; Velmere letter; Hesk/Vell/Daeva letters.
4. Confirm the final nine-item inventory, the uncounted anomaly's exact language, Anchor idle, Shadow sealed, and deployment since the Line.
5. Confirm the exact file-status punctuation and capitalization.
