+2. **Apply edition-wide language defaults:** remove named seasons and metric units, including protected B7 wording and downstream Book 8 callbacks; preserve weather and feet/yards/paces/cords (A2).
+3. **Fix M1's canon lesson:** replace the four-year count with “since his Kindling”; add Storm's air/body and ten/ten/twelve bill; replace the Anchor row with its full B6 history and 10/12/14-ft perception (A3–A5).
