+## F. Re-run after Book 6 M8–M9 close (required)
+
+This section is the analogue of the model audit's §F. It cannot be completed on 2026-10-11 because Book 6 M8 is being drafted and M9 has not started. Re-run against **surviving prose plus the coordinator-rulings and CLOSED notes**, never the author end-state alone.
