+4. Confirm the final nine-item inventory, the uncounted anomaly's exact language, Anchor idle, Shadow sealed, and deployment since the Line.
+5. Confirm the exact file-status punctuation and capitalization.
+6. Replace every B7 “B6 Ch23–24” or old source chapter pointer with actual edition chapters 48–60 and the CLOSED ledger blocks.
+7. Grep the closed Book 6 prose for any final use of a season/month/English weekday, metric unit, or incremented “four years” wording before treating the seam as clean.
+
+---
+
+## G. Proposed order of amendments
+
+1. **Gate the seam:** mark Book 7 §1, the entry ledger, and M1's entry paragraph PENDING B6 M8–M9; replace all source-Ch23–24 drafting directions (A1).
+2. **Apply edition-wide language defaults:** remove named seasons and metric units, including protected B7 wording and downstream Book 8 callbacks; preserve weather and feet/yards/paces/cords (A2).
